msgid ""
"Here you can select who is allowed to shutdown the computer using KDM. "
"Possible values are:<ul> <li><em>All:</em> everybody can shutdown the "
"computer using KDM</li> <li><em>None:</em> nobody can shutdown the computer "
"using KDM</li> <li><em>Root Only:</em> KDM will only allow shutdown after "
"the user has entered the root password</li> <li><em>Console Only:</em> only "
"users sitting in front of this computer can shut it down using KDM</li></ul>"
